WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.220
When you're opening up those
packages under the tree, don't
forget to unwrap the girls

00:06.220 --> 00:09.720
at whisperpearls at
whisperpearls.com.

00:09.720 --> 00:11.220
Happy Holidays!

00:31.000 --> 00:38.000
Don't fall for a flake, that
frost is a phony, my ride is
smooth

00:38.000 --> 00:42.000
Just like a zap on it, I'm your
snowman, baby

00:42.000 --> 00:45.000
You'll want a taste of this ice
cream

00:45.000 --> 01:02.000
[ Music ]

01:02.000 --> 01:04.000
I've seen the forecast

01:04.000 --> 01:06.000
It's the perfect gift

01:06.000 --> 01:08.000
8 inches overnight

01:08.000 --> 01:10.000
If you catch my drift

01:10.000 --> 01:12.000
I'm your snowman, baby

01:12.000 --> 01:15.000
The hotter it blows, the lower
the winch

01:18.000 --> 01:19.000
I'm your snowman, baby

01:19.000 --> 01:21.000
The roads are slippery

01:21.000 --> 01:23.000
So the going is slower

01:24.000 --> 01:26.000
I'm your snowman, baby

01:26.000 --> 01:30.000
I get deeper when the
temperature's lower

01:32.000 --> 01:36.000
Out in the cold, after snow
falls

01:36.000 --> 01:40.000
The perfect time to play with my
snowballs

01:40.000 --> 01:42.000
I'm your snowman, baby

01:42.000 --> 01:45.000
And you can be my snowblower

01:45.000 --> 01:52.000
Hey, baby

01:52.000 --> 01:56.000
Yeah, you wanna get your
driveway cloud

01:58.000 --> 02:01.000
Yeah, I can solve this too, baby

02:03.000 --> 02:06.000
Yeah, clean your sidewalk

02:06.000 --> 02:11.000
All the way to your black door

02:16.000 --> 02:20.000
I'm your snowman, baby

02:20.000 --> 02:23.000
You got me working on the sweat

02:23.000 --> 02:26.000
I'm your snowman, baby

02:26.000 --> 02:28.000
I'm your snowman, baby

02:28.000 --> 02:31.000
And when I'm out, I'm gonna get
wet

02:33.000 --> 02:35.000
Grab my carrot

02:35.000 --> 02:37.000
And give it a yank

02:37.000 --> 02:39.000
I'll make it deposit

02:39.000 --> 02:41.000
In your snowbank

02:41.000 --> 02:43.000
I'm your snowman, baby

02:43.000 --> 02:47.000
And now you know that you've
been frostbitten

03:00.000 --> 03:04.000
People gathering together is the
real joy of the holiday season

03:04.000 --> 03:07.000
Take a few moments to protect
your friends and family

03:07.000 --> 03:09.000
from an unexpected tragedy

03:09.000 --> 03:11.000
Test the smoke alarms in your
home

03:11.000 --> 03:13.000
to make sure they're working

03:13.000 --> 03:15.000
and be certain everyone in your
family knows

03:15.000 --> 03:18.000
and practices your home fire
escape plan

03:18.000 --> 03:20.000
A holiday message from your fire
department

03:20.000 --> 03:22.000
and this station

03:23.750 --> 07:50.000
[ Music ]

07:50.000 --> 07:55.000
Love like Christmas Day
